                "text": "The budget process is an opportunity for Republicans & Democrats to get things done for Michigan families \u2014 re-instate the Child Tax Credit, invest in manufacturing, & protect Social Security, Medicare, & Medicaid.\n\nWe can either prioritize working families or the ultra wealthy. https://t.co/OYlG4rdR3w",
