                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Their plan to give tax breaks to the ultra-wealthy also slashes Medicaid, hurting the 20,000 mid-Michigan seniors who depend on it for health care.\n\nI went to the Village of Hampton Meadows in Bay City to elevate the voices of seniors who would get hurt if they get their way. https://t.co/JJoW0sKz0y",
