                "text": "We'll never get anything real done if we don\u2019t lay out what we\u2019re actually for.\n\n@SenatorSlotkin\u2019s war plan focuses on exactly the right things: lowering costs of things like housing & healthcare, creating good-paying jobs, & making America\u2019s education the best in the world.",
