                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The consequences of cutting health care to pay for handouts to millionaires are real. \n\nAllison is from Flint, and her daughter relies on Medicaid for cancer treatments. Blanket cuts to the program do nothing to make their lives easier. https://t.co/JaBr4Bk1Xi",
